Why is Pandas required in Python?
Pandas is a Python library used for data analysis, data manipulation, and handling structured data such as Excel files, CSV files, databases, and tables.
Think of it this way:
•	NumPy → Works mainly with arrays and numerical calculations.
•	Pandas → Works with rows and columns (like Excel spreadsheets).
